{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2022-01-19 12:30:00', 'title': 'THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY CREATES INTERNATIONAL CONTENT GROUP TO EXPAND PIPELINE OF LOCAL CONTENT AND CONTINUE TO GROW ITS GLOBAL DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER BUSINESS', 'text': "BURBANK, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TO SUPPORT THE ONGOING EXPANSION OF THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY'S (NYSE: DIS) DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER BUSINESS AROUND THE WORLD AND FUEL THE EXPANDING PIPELINE OF LOCAL AND REGIONAL CONTENT FOR ITS STREAMING SERVICES, THE COMPANY IS CREATING A NEW HUB FOR INTERNATIONAL CONTENT CREATION UNDER THE DIRECTION OF REBECCA CAMPBELL AS CHAIRMAN, INTERNATIONAL CONTENT AND OPERATIONS, IT WAS ANNOUNCED TODAY BY BOB CHAPEK, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, THE WALT DISNEY COMPANY. IN ADDIT"}